# SPOTS App Project Overview

## Project Purpose
SPOTS (Supporting Pediatric Oncology Treatment Success) is a Next.js web application designed to help children and teens with cancer and their parents track how the child/teen is feeling throughout their cancer treatments and communicate that information to their health care team.

## Tech Stack
- **Frontend**: Next.js 15, React 18, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
- **Backend**: AWS Amplify Gen2 with Cognito, AppSync, DynamoDB
- **Authentication**: AWS Cognito with Google OAuth
- **Database**: Amazon DynamoDB
- **Deployment**: AWS Amplify

